# Stingblade Assassin: the damage must have been dealt "this turn". Bot1 Lightning Bolts Bot2's Yoked Ox (0/4, so it lives) on turn 3;
# on turn 5 the damage has worn off, so Stingblade Assassin's enters trigger has no legal target (nothing is asked) and the Ox stays.

